    "accepted_residuals": [
      "Single-machine POSIX and local SQLite only; no distributed leases, OS sandbox or universal exactly-once effects.",
      "Sequential fixed DAG; no parallel scheduling, dynamic plans, workflow cancellation API or general durable background task service.",
      "Static node budget reservation and existing soft deadline semantics remain.",
      "Host authenticates actors and versions code, model configuration, policy and privacy changes; graph digests are not implementation fingerprints.",
      "Exact quotations prove current source identity and character ranges, not semantic support for every claim, legal applicability or current law.",
      "Dependencies validate the local record ledger; external files, API freshness and media rights require application verification.",
      "Credential masking is heuristic; host owns PII controls, quotas, external backups, attachments and physical erasure.",
      "Workflow deletion does not delete business records; record retention/deletion is separate.",
      "Inherited optional NLTK exception PYSEC-2026-3740/GHSA-8mgp-746c-j5xp remains accepted under FH-019; all-extras audits use the existing ignore flag."
